{"seq":9,"slug":"criminal-law","title":"刑法与刑事司法","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 刑法与刑事司法：犯罪、刑罚与程序正义\n\n## 定位与边界\n\n刑法是国家运用刑罚权维护社会秩序的基本法律，规定犯罪与刑罚的基本规则，体现国家对公民行为边界的最严厉评价。本 hub 系统梳理刑法的理论基础、具体犯罪类型、诉讼程序运作以及司法改革方向。与法律类目下的兄弟 hub 相比：「法学基础」提供法律体系的总论性框架；「宪法」讨论国家权力的宪法约束与公民基本权利；「侵权法」处理民事侵权的损害赔偿（关注被害人补偿），而刑法关注对犯罪人的惩罚与社会防卫；「行政法」规范行政权力的运行，其处罚手段与刑罚性质不同。本 hub 专注犯罪认定、刑罚适用和刑事程序三大核心问题。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 hub 共四章，从总论到分论、从实体法到程序法、从现行制度到改革前沿：\n\n**第一章 刑法基本原理**——阐述罪刑法定原则与责任主义思想，解析犯罪构成的理论体系（四要件与三阶层的比较），介绍刑罚的正当化根据、种类与适用规则。这是理解全部后续内容的理论地基。\n\n**第二章 具体犯罪**——聚焦当代社会高发犯罪类型：侵犯人身权利犯罪、经济金融犯罪、网络犯罪等新型犯罪形态的立法回应与司法实践。\n\n**第三章 刑事诉讼**——围绕刑事追诉的完整流程：侦查权的行使边界、公诉与自诉的制度设计、证据规则的运用、被告人在各阶段享有的程序性权利。\n\n**第四章 刑事司法改革**——关注当代制度变革方向：量刑规范化改革、恢复性司法理念的引入、认罪认罚从宽制度，以及比较法研究的视角。\n\n建议初学者按顺序学习：先建立第一章的犯罪论与刑罚论框架，再结合第二章的具体罪名深化理解，第三章掌握程序运作逻辑，最后了解第四章的前沿方向。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n建议对以下内容有基本了解：法律规范的基本结构（假定、处理、制裁）、权利与义务的基本概念、中国法律体系的基本层次。如果对这些概念陌生，建议先阅读「法学基础」hub 的第一章。\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [法学基础](../01_legal-fundamentals/)——法律体系的总论性框架与基本概念\n- [宪法](../07_constitutional-law/)——刑事司法中的宪法约束与公民基本权利保障\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"criminal-law-principles","title":"刑法基本原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-law-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legality-and-culpability","title":"罪刑法定与责任主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-law-principles/legality-and-culpability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crime-constitution-theory","title":"犯罪构成理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-law-principles/crime-constitution-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"punishment-theory-and-types","title":"刑罚理论与种类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-law-principles/punishment-theory-and-types"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"specific-crimes","title":"具体犯罪","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/specific-crimes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crimes-against-person","title":"侵犯人身权利犯罪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/specific-crimes/crimes-against-person"},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-and-financial-crimes","title":"经济金融犯罪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/specific-crimes/economic-and-financial-crimes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cybercrime-and-emerging-offenses","title":"网络犯罪与新型犯罪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/specific-crimes/cybercrime-and-emerging-offenses"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"criminal-procedure","title":"刑事诉讼","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-procedure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"investigation-and-prosecution","title":"侦查与起诉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-procedure/investigation-and-prosecution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trial-and-evidence","title":"审判与证据制度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-procedure/trial-and-evidence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rights-of-accused","title":"被告人权利保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-procedure/rights-of-accused"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"criminal-justice-reform","title":"刑事司法改革","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-justice-reform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sentencing-reform","title":"量刑改革","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-justice-reform/sentencing-reform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"restorative-justice","title":"恢复性司法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-justice-reform/restorative-justice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"comparative-criminal-law","title":"比较刑法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/criminal-law/criminal-justice-reform/comparative-criminal-law"}]}]}